# value-typed-with-inline-comment

## Input

```
a 42 # count
b true # enabled

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..30
  ENTRY@0..13
    WORD_KEY@0..1
      WORD@0..1 "a"
    SPACE@1..2 " "
    INTEGER@2..4
      NUMERAL@2..4 "42"
    COMMENT@4..12 " # count"
    NEWLINE@12..13 "\n"
  ENTRY@13..30
    WORD_KEY@13..14
      WORD@13..14 "b"
    SPACE@14..15 " "
    BOOLEAN@15..19
      TRUE@15..19 "true"
    COMMENT@19..29 " # enabled"
    NEWLINE@29..30 "\n"
```

## AST

```
SourceFile {
    items: [
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@0..1 "a",
            },
            value: Integer {
                sign: none,
                numeral: NUMERAL@2..4 "42",
            },
        },
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@13..14 "b",
            },
            value: Boolean {
                token: TRUE@15..19 "true",
            },
        },
    ],
}
```

